4. PLANHOTEL HOSPITALITY GROUP
-Location: Diani Beach, P.O Box 84383 – 80100, Mombasa, Kenya
-Description:Situated on 38 acres of beachfront property, Diamonds Leisure Beach & Golf Resort features an 18-hole golf course overlooking the Indian Ocean. The resort also offers a casino, spa and outdoor swimming pool.

Each air-conditioned room and suite comes with modern African-inspired décor, satellite TV and a safety deposit box. The en-suite bathroom includes complimentary toiletries.

Guests can relax on Diani Beach or with a massage at the Lotus Health & Relaxation Centre. They can also enjoy activities such as scuba diving or a round of golf.

The shopping arcade offers handicrafts and souvenirs. A Kids club, tour desk and various event facilities are also available. Diani Restaurant provides guests with ocean views as they dine.

Diamonds Leisure Beach Resort & Spa is located just 10 minutes’ drive from Colombus Trust and 15 minutes' drive from the Kaya Kinondo sacred forest. Likoni Ferry is 35 km away and Mombasa International Airport is 42 km from the resort.

Couples particularly like the location — they rated it 9.3 for a two-person trip.

